    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερο-μερής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leaning to one side,
				one-sided</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crito
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.3.64
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρῶς</span>
			<i>onesidedly</i> (i.e.not in equal proportions), <i><span class="en">
				Speus.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				61
			</span></i> (nisi leg. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρεῖς</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἑ.</span>
			<i>separation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.25a
			</span></i>.</div>
